  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Revolution**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Hurry Up and Wait**: back after 25 archived shows (1589 days) [3]\n- **Liquid**: back after 25 archived shows (1589 days) [3]\n- **Curse Lifter**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2019-07-20.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 15 songs; 159 min [1]\n- **soulive2019-07-20.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 15 songs; 159 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2019-07-20.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Mics/Room Mics/SBD Matrix [1]. Also: Matrix of two Schoeps mics (one on stage, one at the FOH booth) plus a soundboard feed, recorded through Sonosax preamps to a Sound Devices 788T at 24/96; This is the 24-bit version, not meant for CD burning; a 16-bit version is offered separately [1]\n- **soulive2019-07-20.cmc621.cmc641vxt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Mics/Room Mics/SBD Matrix [2]. Also: Matrix of Schoeps cmc621 (on stage), cmc641vxt (FOH booth) and Avid Profile soundboard feed, recorded on a Sound Devices 788T at 24/96; Eric McRoberts mixed and edited it on 22-23 July 2019 using SoundForge and Vegas Pro, then dithered down to 16-bit 44.1 [2]",
